  "id": "moog-messenger",
  "name": "Moog Messenger",
  "manufacturer": "Moog",
  "family": "Messenger",
  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Moog Messenger monophonic analog synthesizer: the MIDI CC tables of its manual.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Messenger User Manual (2025-06-18)",
      "notes": "MIDI CC table (pages 35, 36, 37) read by tools/profiles/moog/read-moog-pdf.mjs from Messenger_Manual_20250618.pdf (sha256 fea7f422bccda3f3fb34de66ce1c18a2738ac15c0cd261bc42ca29f370b921cf), https://cdn.inmusicbrands.com/Moog/Messenger/Messenger_Manual_20250618.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/moog/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/moog/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI tables, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "No identity check: the manual prints no Device Inquiry reply.",
    "30 knob(s) are printed as an MSB and an LSB, 0 - 16383 together; CEditor sends the MSB alone, 0 - 127, which the manual says the instrument takes by itself: Mod Wheel (CC 1, LSB 33); Tempo (CC 2, LSB 34); LFO 1 Rate (CC 3, LSB 35); LFO 1 Depth (CC 4, LSB 36); Glide Rate (CC 5, LSB 37); Master Volume (CC 7, LSB 39); Noise Level (CC 8, LSB 40); OSC 1 Waveshape (CC 9, LSB 41); OSC Tune (CC 10, LSB 42); Expression Pedal (CC 11, LSB 43); OSC 2 Freq (CC 12, LSB 44); OSC Mod Amount (CC 13, LSB 45); OSC 2 Waveshape (CC 14, LSB 46); OSC 1 Level (CC 15, LSB 47); OSC 2 Level (CC 16, LSB 48); Sub OSC Level (CC 17, LSB 49); FB/Ext In Level (CC 18, LSB 50); Filter Cutoff (CC 19, LSB 51); OSC 2 - Cutoff Amount (CC 20, LSB 52); Filter Resonance (CC 21, LSB 53); Filter EG Amount (CC 22, LSB 54); Filter EG Attack (CC 23, LSB 55); Filter EG Decay (CC 24, LSB 56); Filter EG Sustain (CC 25, LSB 57); Filter EG Release (CC 26, LSB 58); LFO 2 Rate (CC 27, LSB 59); Amp EG Attack (CC 28, LSB 60); Amp EG Decay (CC 29, LSB 61); Amp EG Sustain (CC 30, LSB 62); Amp EG Release (CC 31, LSB 63).",
    "A number, not a choice, where its bands are printed out of order (0-31, 32-64, 64-95, 96-127): OSC Mod Destination (CC 72).",
    "Left out, MIDI's data entry controller: Data Entry (CC 6).",
    "Left out, switched by an MPE Activation message (RPN 6), not by this controller: MPE 3rd Dimension of Control (CC 74)."
  ],
